e comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-17T21:26:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"North Texas QB Tayven Jackson out with upper-body injury","description":"North Texas senior quarterback Tayven Jackson, who is sixth in the FBS with 3,005 passing yards, will miss at least the next two games with an upper-body injury.","published":"2026-11-17T20:53:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50513204/north-texas-qb-tayven-jackson-upper-body-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Defiant Dabo Swinney says Clemson's 'gonna win a bunch more'","description":"Despite going through a self-described \"rough patch\" over the past two seasons, Clemson coach Dabo Swinney is resolute in his belief that he and the Tigers have a lot more wins ahead of them.","published":"2026-11-17T20:37:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512833/defiant-dabo-swinney-says-clemson-gonna-win-bunch-more","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Army OC Cody Worley to be Furman head coach","description":"Army offensive coordinator Cody Worley is expected to be the next head coach at Furman, sources told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-17T20:11:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512672/army-oc-worley-furman-head-coach","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Former Iowa State AD calls NIL system 'money laundering'","description":"Former Iowa State athletic director Jamie Pollard delivered a scorching appraisal of college athletics to the Knight Commission, equating NIL as a money-laundering operation.","published":"2026-11-17T19:08:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50512485/former-iowa-state-ad-calls-nil-system-money-laundering","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Purdue rolls with FAA ground stop by taking buses to Iowa","description":"Unable to travel by plane, the Boilermakers rolled with the situation and found some good times on the way.","published":"2026-11-17T11:28:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504665/purdue-faa-ground-stop-bus-iowa","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman of Week 11: Duke's Nate Sheppard has entered the running","description":"In a season in which star running backs seem to be popping up out of nowhere, the Blue Devils' sophomore stands out.","published":"2026-11-17T14:55:53.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503621/heisman-watch-week-11-duke-nate-sheppard","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5226976/romanas-frederique-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OJ_Frederique_Jr."},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"OJ Frederique Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OJ_Frederique_Jr.","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:34Z","intro":"Romanas 'OJ' Frederique Jr. is an American college football cornerback for the Miami Hurricanes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Frederique attended St. Thomas Aquinas High School in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. Coming out of high school, he was rated as a three-star recruit and held offers from schools such as Florida State, Miami, Ole Miss, UCF, and West Virginia. Frederique committed to play college football for the West Virginia Mountaineers. However, he flipped his commitment to the Miami Hurricanes."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Frederique got his first career start in week two of the 2024 season, where he recorded two tackles and a pass deflection in a win over Florida A&M. In week nine, he recorded a tackle and a pass deflection in a win over Florida State. In week 11, Frederique tallied five tackles and two pass deflections in a loss to Georgia Tech."}]}}